      383.3
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends the First Schedule of the Inland Revenue Act, No. 24 of2017 and the legal effect of that Schedule as amended is to increase the income tax rateapplicable to the Employees Trust Fund, an approved provident or pension fund, or anapproved termination fund up to 30% and the income tax rate applicable to the fundswhich effectively participate in the process of domestic debt optimization to continueas 14%.",
