    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      251.85,
      401.84,
      274.33
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      288.95,
      396.94,
      311.53
    ],
    "text": "1. (1) This Act may be cited as the Inland Revenue(Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      326.25,
      396.81,
      348.73
    ],
    "text": "(2) The provisions of this Act shall be deemed to havecome into operation on April 1, 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      363.35,
      401.86,
      410.65
    ],
    "text": "2. The First Schedule to the Inland Revenue Act, No.24of 2017 is hereby amended by the repeal of paragraph 8 ofthat Schedule and the substitution therefor, of the followingparagraph: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      425.39,
      401.86,
      460.11
    ],
    "text": "\u201c8. Tax rate for Employees Trust Funds,Provident, Pension or Gratuity Funds andTermination Funds.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      475.05,
      401.91,
      559.45
    ],
    "text": "(1) The taxable income of the Employees TrustFund, an approved provident or pension fund, oran approved termination fund for a year ofassessment commencing on or prior to April 1, 2022and for the first six months period of the year ofassessment commencing on April 1, 2023 shall betaxed at the rate of 14%.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      574.29,
      401.9,
      671.05
    ],
    "text": "(2) Subject to subparagraphs (3) and (4), thetaxable income of the Employees Trust Fund, anapproved provident or pension fund or an approvedtermination fund for the second six months periodof the year of assessment commencing on April 1,2023 and for each year of assessment commencingon or after April 1, 2024, shall be taxed at the rateof 14%.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
